o be  in danger seeing gimodello cry over  knocked like that was both  sad and kind of adorable and you just  know that guimodello and the other three  devils have an emotional connection to  noct  this isn't just a contract of  convenience as is the case with most  other devil users  and their devils noct and his devils  seem to actually  care about each other i'm not sure what  exactly guimotello meant when he said  that if noct  dies then his devils won't be safe but i  am interested in learning more about  that  maybe that depends on the nature of the  contract  itself because i definitely can't see  lucifer dying  if dante is ever killed lilith and namah  even said that dante was just lucifer's  toy  so i'm like 200 sure that if dante died  lucifer would be just fine  this whole exchange between gimodello  and noct reminded me that we still have  a lot to learn about the connection  between devils  and devil users and there is a lot to  learn about how exactly that  relationship  works now noct is of course happy that  asta is finally here because he believes  that asta will turn out to be the key to  defeating the devils  and the dark triad but noct says that he  and his own life don't really matter in  the grand scheme of things  no matter what happens to knocked in the  end as long as the dark triad is  defeated he will be happy  he's basically telling asta not to focus  on helping him but to focus on the  battle  and if knocked dies then it's no big  deal but  osta shuts down that line of thinking  real quick  he tells knox that his life most  certainly does matter  because if it hadn't been for him asta  would never have gotten this strong  so asta wants noc to live and to see the  full extent  of asta's new power a power that would  have been impossible to attain  without noct's help ever since his  brother died  noct felt that he should have been the  one to die instead of morgan  he blamed himself for his brother's  death and he felt that the good  kind and noble brother died and the  selfish  unworthy and dishonorable brother lived  knocked seems to have believed that  dying in battle as a magic knight was  the only way to make up for his tragic  decision to summon  lucy fugus the tragic decision that led  to the death of his brother  so basically knocked entire purpose in  life since morgan's death has been to  atone for his  sins by sacrificing his own life in a  noble way for a good cause  noct seems to have felt that this was  the only way to stop himself from  feeling that terrible guilt that he has  felt  every day since his brother died and  that must be why  during this battle against the devils  noct has repeatedly and frequently  talked about  sacrificing himself it's like he already  made the decision to sacrifice his life  ahead of time and he was just looking  for the right  opportunity but asta is trying to tell  him that the purpose of his life  isn't to die in this battle his purpose  is to live  and do good in this life things that  matter  and things that will make a difference  in the fight against  evil and of course this includes  training asta  and allowing him to attain such a great  level of power  and in this moment noct sees his own  brother morgan  in asta asta is exactly the type of  selfless  honorable and heroic person that his  brother was  even though asta never met morgan his  spirit and his  attitude embodies the essence of who  morgan was  and so in a metaphorical sense a new  morning  anu morgen has arrived however  asta quickly reminds us that his new  epic power-up  does have one serious limitation one  minute has already passed  since he first entered his devil union  mode  and that means that he now only has 4  minutes left to defeat both lilith and  amma  before his time runs out and he has to  let go of the devil union mode  but far from looking defeated lilith and  the ma  are ecstatic in all the hundreds of  years that they spent in the underworld  they never had this much fun they've  never encountered such an  interesting challenge and they can't  wait to unleash their full power  against asta meanwhile inside of us  liebe is fully conscious and he has a  wide grin  on his lips liba clearly recognizes  lilith and namah and he says that he  never thought that he would meet  them again in this world this confirms  the fan theory that lieben knows lilith  and them  from before from back when he still  lived in the underworld  and this little fact makes the upcoming  fight  even more interesting this is no longer  just a fight between osta and some  random devils these two devils likely  bullied and abused liba  in the early stages of his life so now  this fight is personal it is about  revenge that personal connection between  liba and the devils  raises the stakes even further and it  gives liba  additional motivation but this also  means that liebe could lose his cool  during the battle and do something rash  something that might hurt his and asta's  chances of  winning the fight hopefully not but you  never know because  liebe spent so many years focusing on  his hatred against the devils  and plotting his revenge lilith and the  moth then  launched their devil ice and devil fire  magic directly at asta  but asta uses black hurricane to cut  through  and dispel both magic attacks asta then  chases after lilith and the ma  trying to slash them with the demon  dweller's sword  but the two devils are extremely fast  they are able to dodge  osta while at the same time pursuing him  as a predator stalks  its prey rather than being scared of  asta after seeing what his auntie magic  can do  lilith and emma are just having fun and  playing a game to see who can kill  us the first after realizing that his  current strategy  isn't working and being aware that he  has to end this battle  as soon as possible osta pulls out the  demon slayer  and demon destroyer swords but here's  the thing  asta's demon destroyer sword looks  different now  it's as if the sword itself has gone  through a power up  along with osta it seems that the devil  union mode is having a real physical  effect  on the sword as well and not only does  the demon destroy her sword look  very different it also somehow manages  to negate  all the magic in the immediate area  including of course the magic of  lilith and namah the two devils are  confused about what happened  how did their devil ice and devil fire  magic just  disappear and while they're standing  around confused  asta grabs the demon slayer's sword with  his other hand  and slices through namas body on  that crazy and potentially game changing  note  the chapter ends whoa  does this mean that asta unlocked the  ability to create some sort of  anti-mana zone with the help of the  demon destroyer sword  so instead of being able to manipulate  all the mana in the surrounding area  as with a traditional monozone ability  asta is able to  instantly negate all of the mana in the  surrounding  area that would be so insane and so  overpowered and you better believe that  anyone who encounters this ability for  the first time would be caught off guard  and thoroughly confused which of course  allows asta to take advantage of that  brief confusion  and attack and that is exactly what he  did to nama  wow what an amazing fight this has  already been  but we know that it can't go on for long  because of how limited  asta's time is so does this mean that  asta has already defeated nema  and now he just needs to take down  lilith or  is defeating these highest ranked devils  going to be more complicated than that  like for example is it possible that  lilith and amma can somehow survive  being cut by anti-magic by regenerating  extremely  fast or can they maybe fuse into a  single devil since they do appear to be  twins and may be part of one greater  whole  personally i don't know how this battle  is going to play out but i can't wait  to find out and of course even if foster  is 